# Netlify SPA fallback for the @br/web game client.
#
# The game client is a Vite SPA with @solidjs/router doing client-side
# routing for /play/*, /character, /character/create, /home, /login,
# /loading/:variant, /play/editor, etc. Without this rewrite a direct
# visit (or refresh) on any of those URLs would return 404 because
# Netlify can't find a matching file in dist/. The 200 status keeps the
# URL bar showing the requested path while serving the SPA shell, which
# then hydrates the right route.
#
# This file is the authoritative redirect rule; the equivalent
# [[redirects]] block in apps/web/netlify.toml is dead weight under the
# current monorepo packagePath dashboard config (Netlify reads no toml).
# Vite copies public/ verbatim into dist/, so this lands at dist/_redirects
# where Netlify's publish-dir scanner picks it up unconditionally.

/*    /index.html   200
